  "description": "Run by an analyst on an alert to try every VMRay1 action on a nested zip with several child files. The Test integration downloads the archive, VMRay1 submits it, waits for the analysis, builds and posts the report, then each Get action runs once on the sample (IOCs, VTIs, Mitre ATT&CK techniques, screenshots, analysis archive, VMRay's own report, child samples, one child's report, relations), plus two hash lookups. Consumes VMRay quota. Before use: select your VMRay1 account on the VMRay1 nodes. The Test integration needs no account.",
